# Knowledge Trainer source PDF — one download per execution

A durable source document may be downloaded from remote Storage **at most once per worker execution** for the same immutable source identity (`documentId` + `storage_bucket` + `storage_key` + content hash).

Page-level processing MUST consume an already-acquired source handle from `knowledge-trainer-pdf-source.ts`.

## Required flow

Remote Storage → job-scoped PDF source (temp file) → count pages / text / layout / retries / future OCR / future source-evidence processing.

## Forbidden

- `storage.download` / `downloadOwnerLegalMaterial()` inside page processors
- Per-page full-source fetch (text, layout, OCR, source notes, legal-text, retries)
- Silent fallback: `cache failed → storage.download()` in a page processor

A cache miss may cause **one** acquisition through the source abstraction. It must not restore per-page Storage downloads.

## Allowed remote owners

- `knowledge-trainer-pdf-source.ts` — execution cache
- `knowledge-trainer-storage.service.ts` — `downloadOwnerLegalMaterial` used **only** as the cache download adapter
- Owner UI signed URLs are not worker extraction

Durable truth stays `storage_bucket` + `storage_key`. Temp files are never domain truth, Postgres, aggregates, or frontend.
